1610|n|A considerable collection of books kept for use, and not as merchandise; as, a private library; a public library. ; A building or apartment appropriated for holding such a collection of books.	a:k2p,81,99;1bx9,57,31;bhu,44,5;99g,41,4;izy,39,3;y0m,38,3;125u,36,4;1mo0,28,15;1imv,28,6;16lz,27,6~k2p,81,99;1bx9,57,31;1mo0,28,15;1imv,28,6;16lz,27,6;bhu,44,5;18me,24,5;1hx0,7,5;on3,18,4;125u,36,4	v:12bz,94,5;vn4,11,3;izx,3,4~12bz,94,5;izx,3,4;vn4,11,3	V:1t0n,24,9;15k9,7,3;26ei,5,4~1t0n,24,9;26ei,5,4;15k9,7,3	n:15qt,81,3;1n9a,60,12;25l6,47,208;adh,47,8;dsh,34,15;1ow4,24,10;1610,23,3;1wcr,18,3;1wa6,14,6;18db,6,6~25l6,47,208;dsh,34,15;1n9a,60,12;1ow4,24,10;adh,47,8;18db,6,6;1wa6,14,6;1wcr,18,3;1610,23,3;15qt,81,3	N:uhe,105,5;1u6o,96,6;16kg,61,6;b4a,59,1;d1t,52,4;1ywm,52,5;18uf,52,4;qti,51,4;4eb,48,3;524,40,3~hi,36,22;1xc2,33,10;20f9,18,10;16kg,61,6;1u6o,96,6;1ywm,52,5;uhe,105,5;18uf,52,4;d1t,52,4;qti,51,4
