164s|n|A discharge of atmospheric electricity, accompanied by a vivid flash of light, commonly from one cloud to another, sometimes from a cloud to the earth. The sound produced by the electricity in passing rapidly through the atmosphere constitutes thunder. ; The act of making bright, or the state of being made bright; enlightenment; brightening, as of the mental powers. ; Lightening.	N:9j0,112,3~9j0,112,3
