16ix|n|One who, or that which, lives. ; A resident; a dweller; as, a liver in Brooklyn. ; One whose course of life has some marked characteristic (expressed by an adjective); as, a free liver. ; A very large glandular and vascular organ in the visceral cavity of all vertebrates. ; The glossy ibis (Ibis falcinellus); -- said to have given its name to the city of Liverpool.	N:x1z,91,3~x1z,91,3
