16jt|n|Any one of the numerous species of reptiles belonging to the order Lacertilia; sometimes, also applied to reptiles of other orders, as the Hatteria. ; A piece of rope with thimble or block spliced into one or both of the ends. ; A piece of timber with a forked end, used in dragging a heavy stone, a log, or the like, from a field.	a:kom,116,2~kom,116,2
